# A turn whose provider call failed and will be made again. The retry
# indicator replaces the working one and counts down on the same row, so this
# is a running turn with `Working...` nowhere on the pane. The agent is still
# there afterwards, the way pi is: whoever is driving this scenario decides
# when it ends.
screen boot
sleep 50
screen working
sleep 50
screen retrying
sleep 600000
